-- Added vehicles (docs/cars.md): models from the Extended Vanilla Vehicles Pack Reboot 2.0 and three
-- retextures, each a new model of its own (engineRequestModel) built on the vanilla `parent`; no vanilla
-- model is replaced. Seeded once from the pack's vehicles.ide, handling.cfg, carcols.dat, cargrp.dat and
-- vehicle names.fxt; ours from here on.
--   name      the model name (and its files mods/evvpr/<name>.dff, .txd; noTxd: it has no TXD of its
--             own and uses the parent's)
--   label     the game text key of its name; display: the name when the game text has no such key
--   handling  its handling.cfg line (the pack's), applied to the new model
--   colours   its carcols.dat colour sets (primary, secondary[, 3rd, 4th])
--   groups    popcycle car groups it joins (cargrp.dat order: 0 workers ... 16 desert folk)
--   credit    the model's author (Mod Authors (Vehicles).txt)
